msgctxt "bark 0589:06EC"
msgid "Truly an excellent performance overall. You are worthy of the title Acolyte. Now, defend yourself from -my- daemon. Banish it and you will be ready for the Ritual of Flame. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:0772"
msgid "You have failed the third test, Disciple. Prepare to die. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:07F3"
msgid "I did not ask you to summon a daemon, Disciple. You have failed... prepare to die. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:0F72"
msgid "This is far better than I had hoped! If you will return to me my staff, we can begin the ceremony. Just put it anywhere, and be quick about it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:1035"
msgid "Drop the staff. We must leave now, Acolyte. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:10D1"
msgid "I said drop it. This is your last warning, Acolyte. I do not need you so much that I will accept your insubordination. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:116E"
msgid "I see. You wish to test me. Well, I have passed or I have failed. But in either case, it won't matter to you. You will be dead! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "bark 0589:120A"
msgid "I did not ask you to banish a daemon, Disciple. You have failed... prepare to die. "
msgstr ""
